section.para:
Resource Monitoring Clients can use the
{@link ResourceMonitoringService#createContext(String, ResourceContext)}
method to create ResourceContext instances.

The
{@link ResourceMonitoringService#createContext(String, ResourceContext)}
method has been invoked.

formalpara.para:
the type of the event. One of:



{@link #RESOURCE_CONTEXT_CREATED}



{@link #RESOURCE_CONTEXT_REMOVED}



{@link #BUNDLE_ADDED}



{@link #BUNDLE_REMOVED}
